data: {"id": "1e837b11acef4317-thinking-parallel_evidence-457", "run_id": "1e837b11acef4317", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "**关键发现：Pod 当前仍处于 Pending 状态，调度失败原因为 `node affinity/selector` 不匹配。**\n\n从 `kubectl describe` 结果：\n- **Node-Selectors**: `aiops.lab/unavailable=true`\n- **事件**: `3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector`\n\n这表明 Pod 被调度到所有 3 个节点都失败，原因是节点选择器 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true` 在所有节点上都不匹配（即没有节点有这个标签，或标签值不是 `true`）。\n\n接下来需要验证：检查集群中节点的 `aiops.lab/unavailable` 标签值，确认这是否确实是根因。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788762536388, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

